sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Op as Operator
  participant UI as React console (Activity)
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant Repo as WatchlistRepository
  participant DB as Database
  Op->>UI: Open Activity
  par Confirmed identifications
    UI->>API: GET /api/alerts
    API->>Repo: actionable_decisions()
    Repo->>DB: Query CONFIRMED decisions
    API-->>UI: Confirmed decisions and their reviews
  and Audit trail
    UI->>API: GET /api/audit
    API->>Repo: audit_trail()
    Repo->>DB: Query audit events
    API-->>UI: Append-only event list
  end
  UI-->>Op: Confirmed identifications and full history
